 백패킹 캠핑 루프탑 온도내리기 추천방법!","url":"https://www.5gcamp.com/?c=info/camptip"},{"text":"우스스토브(+로켓스토브) 0원으로 만들기!","url":"https://www.5gcamp.com/?c=info/camptip"},{"text":"요리(비어치킨+스테이크)도 불멍(장작)도 문제없는 천하무적 화로대 제작하기~feat.","url":"https://www.5gcamp.com/?c=info/camptip"},{"text":"솔로스토브","url":"https://www.5gcamp.com/?c=info/camptip"},{"text":"캠프타운 | 캠프타운 프리랜더 설치 동영상(차박 텐트)","url":"https://www.5gcamp.com/?c=info/tent"}],"field_conditions":{"version":2,"status":"SURVEYED","parking":{"state":"UNKNOWN","mode":"UNKNOWN","tent_side":null,"cart_required":null,"shared_nearby":null,"drop_off_external":null,"auto_camping_sites":null},"shelter_setup":{"state":"UNKNOWN","max_tents":null,"max_tarps":null,"canopy_allowed":null,"note":null},"power":{"state":"CONFIRMED","available":true,"limit_w":null,"regulatory_reference_w":600,"breaker_capacity":null,"statutory_standard":true,"high_power_mention":null},"ground":{"state":"UNKNOWN","types":[]},"charcoal":{"state":"SURVEYED","allowed":true},"firewood":{"state":"SURVEYED","allowed":true,"sold":true},"fire_pit":{"state":"SURVEYED","arrangement":"개별"},"site_size":{"state":"CONFIRMED","groups":[{"width_m":6,"depth_m":9,"count":19},{"width_m":8,"depth_m":9,"count":12},{"width_m":7,"depth_m":8,"count":3}]},"sanitary":{"state":"CONFIRMED","toilets_count":null,"showers_count":20,"sinks_count":20,"private_bathroom":false,"private_bathroom_state":"UNKNOWN","hot_water":"제공","note":null},"features":["SWIMMING_POOL","EXPERIENCE","FOREST_TRAIL"],"rental_offers":[],"source":{"label":"한국관광공사 고캠핑 운영자 등록 및 공식 소개 전수조사","url":"https://www.gocamping.or.kr/bsite/camp/info/read.do?c_no=100879","checked_at":"2024-07-15T00:00:00+09:00","tier":"A"}},"spec":{"version":1,"generated_at":"2026-10-24T13:53:10.529Z","fields":{"CHECKIN_TIME":{"grade":"MENTION","values":[],"mentions":[{"value":"14:00부터","count":1,"latest":"2026-09-03","samples":[{"quote":"캠핑인데요~ 8월 마지막주 캠핑은 태안에 있는 “어은돌 캠프캠프 캠핑장”으로 다녀왔어요 :) 어은돌 캠프캠프 eoeundol campcamp 어은돌캠프캠프 충청남도 태안군 소원면 모항파도로 398-84 어은돌캠프캠프 ➰